      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "§ 4. Continuation of MOFTB. Nothing in this Order shall affect the jurisdiction of MOFTB as set forth in Executive Order No. 47, dated January 4, 1993, as amended by Executive Order No. 49, dated September 13, 2004. Staffing and other assistance to the Mayor's Office of Film, Theatre and Broadcasting may be provided by DOITT, the Department of Small Business Services (\"DSBS\") or by any other appropriate agency. MOFTB's function of issuing all permits required for film and television production and for still photography shoots in the City shall remain in DSBS. To preserve the regulatory jurisdiction of MOFTB, the commissioner of MOME shall be a DSBS employee and shall manage all appropriate DOITT staff.",
